sequenceDiagram
  participant A as User A Browser
  participant W as Worker /api/chat
  participant R as Durable Object ChatRoom
  participant B as User B Browser

  A->>W: WebSocket connect
  W->>R: room.fetch(request)
  A->>R: hello { id, alias }
  R-->>A: me { me, users }
  R-->>B: users { users }
  A->>R: message { type, text/image }
  R-->>A: message { senderId, sender, ... }
  R-->>B: message { senderId, sender, ... }
  A->>R: name / clear
  R-->>A: users / clear
  R-->>B: users / clear
